  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvb-uy/cdn/cc908ac6fdaf59df26e6be8b96ca028a00860a0c/desc/create-questing/banner.webp\" width=\"1123\" height=\"429\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=7693ef&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"258\" height=\"33\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<em><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/aoc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/MADE FOR-ALL OF CREATE-393939?style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&labelColor=7693ef&logoColor=white\" width=\"269\" height=\"33\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"font-size:8px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252felocindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ElocinDev-SUPPORT ME-393939?style=for-the-badge&logo=Ko-Fi&labelColor=7693ef&logoColor=white\" width=\"260\" height=\"33\"></a></span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>为 FTB Quests 的 Create 章节添加了类似 Create 风格的蓝图主题。该模组支持高度自定义，你可以通过 `create_questing.json` 配置文件选择多个章节，并修改颜色、尺寸等更多选项！<br>此外，还增加了“蓝图”物品，其功能与任务书相同，但支持合成制作，更贴合 Create 模组的主题风格。</p>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvb-uy/cdn/cc908ac6fdaf59df26e6be8b96ca028a00860a0c/desc/create-questing/1.webp\" width=\"1123\" height=\"827\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvb-uy/cdn/cc908ac6fdaf59df26e6be8b96ca028a00860a0c/desc/create-questing/2.webp\" width=\"1123\" height=\"446\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvb-uy/cdn/cc908ac6fdaf59df26e6be8b96ca028a00860a0c/desc/create-questing/3.webp\" width=\"1119\" height=\"445\"></p>",
